The Apple Inc. copyright above is carried deliberately.  qwasar does not link
against MLX, but two of its Metal kernels follow the structure of MLX's, which
were read closely while writing them: the gated-delta recurrence takes its grid
layout, per-lane state slicing and simd_sum reduction from MLX's kernel, and the
attention kernel follows MLX's vector-SDPA shape.  MLX is MIT licensed, so
nothing here requires this notice; it is kept because the debt is real.  See
THIRD-PARTY.md.

qwasar also vendors linenoise, which is BSD-2-Clause and carries its own notice.
That one is an obligation, not a courtesy.  See THIRD-PARTY.md.
